Carbon ash on the rim of your glass wrote:
>
> Is a blessed touchstone one of the things that cannot be wished for?

There are no restrictions on wishing for a touchstone.  Success at
wishing for blessed objects depends on your numerical luck.  Make very
sure you have positive luck when you make the wish.  If you failed to
get one maybe you typed the name wrong or maybe you had negative luck.

> If so is there a sure way to get one?

There aren't any guaranteed ones in the regular mines end levels but
there are random gems.  I've gotten a touchstone in mines end from the
random chance before.  I don't know if any of the patches or variants
have guaranteed touchstone.

Do you know how to identify the various types of gray stones?  Using the
spoilers it's straightforward to tell each type.


